not caused by bug 3ff9-a8f0-ff5a-457f's logging change (that change is log-level/wording only and was verified failing identically before and after).\n\nFailure: tests/_git_upkeep.py:203 — \"a push left detached background upkeep running against .../origin-build/origin.git: [['git','maintenance','run','--auto','--quiet','--detach']]\".\n\n## Reproduction (deterministic, 2/2 on origin/main)\n\npython -m pytest tests/unit/test_push_strict.py tests/unit/test_push_strict_happy.py tests/unit/test_push_rejection_surfacing.py tests/unit/test_push_pending_marker.py tests/unit/test_push_callers_best_effort.py tests/unit/test_push_narrow_refspec.py tests/unit/test_push_retry_stash_pop.py tests/unit/test_commit_and_push_tickets_branch.py tests/unit/test_commit_and_push_tickets_branch_heldout.py tests/unit/test_epoch_guard_matrix.py tests/unit/test_c3b_push_defer_coupling_heldout.py tests/integration/test_epoch_guard_reconciliation.py tests/interfaces/store/test_fsck_push_pending.py tests/interfaces/store/test_inline_write_push.py -q -p no:cacheprovider\n\nProbed pairs that PASS (so the polluter is a longer-chain or state-threshold interaction): rejection_surfacing+inline, epoch_guard_matrix+inline, push_pending_marker+inline, commit_and_push(+heldout)+inline, fsck_push_pending+inline.\n\n## Suspected mechanism (unconfirmed)\n\ngit only auto-detaches maintenance past object/pack thresholds; earlier suites' real-git activity may push the fixture origin past a threshold, or the trace2 scope picks up upkeep the fixture build spawned. Root-cause per /rebar-debug before any fix.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Root cause of the ordering-dependent detached upkeep is confirmed with a driven experiment (cited path:line evidence on the ticket).\n- [ ] The reproduction selection above passes deterministically after the fix.\n- [ ] test_a_write_pushing_to_the_origin_leaves_no_detached_upkeep still fails RED when a push genuinely leaves detached upkeep (the oracle keeps its teeth).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d720-fc72-3763-4cac","ticket_type":"bug","title":"test_a_write_pushing_to_the_origin_leaves_no_detached_upkeep fails under a multi-suite push-test selection (ordering pollution)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c8e16b79-d461-48c4-a4a4-3c7bae4f7742","3f9fcb9c-9518-4081-9d5b-7121518ae0a1"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787341657524698001,"uuid":"bbd46544-00ca-43f0-a041-628fb4dd87d0"}